{
    "title": "Car Play for Android/Auto sync",
    "description": "Car Play for android/auto sync app simplifies the process of integrating your smartphone to the dashboard of your car. Android car play app helps you connect your phone with the car\u2019s infotainment system for safer driving experience. Access to maps, navigation and calls from your car\u2019s dashboard has now become effortless with car play for android/auto sync app. With the integration of phone features into your car dashboard, you can access certain features like Maps, Contacts, weather, time and Calls on the car dashboard. So, make and manage calls from the car dashboard using car play for android. If you have ever used Apple Carplay or Android Auto app while driving on the road, you must be aware of its seamless integration and intuitive interface, our car play for android/auto sync is also designed to give you a seamless integration with a user-friendly interface.\r\n\r\nIf you are an Android user and want to enjoy the functionalities of Apple CarPlay or Android Auto, then you can still enjoy those benefits with our car play for android/auto sync. Car play aims at enhancing your driving experience whether you are an Apple CarPlay or an Android Auto user. You can still enjoy our app if you are an Apple CarPlay or an Android Auto app user.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features of car play for android/auto sync</b>\r\n\r\n1.<b>Car Driving Mode:</b>\r\nStay updated with integration of phone features into car dashboard. Use car driving mode to access contacts, make calls and use maps. Keep yourself informed with current date and time displayed on your dashboard in the Driving Mode. You can use the speedometer widget to track the speed of the car in Driving Mode of car play for android/auto sync.\r\n\r\n2. <b>Car Parking Map:</b>\r\nOur car play for android/auto sync provides car parking feature where you can save your car location and use maps for navigation to find and track your car in parking, manage parked car history and locate your parked car with a click.\r\n\r\n3. <b>Fuel Chart Tracker:</b>\r\nYou can track fuel consumption for your trips and monthly fuel consumption. Add your trip details like distance travelled and fuel prices to calculate the total cost.\r\n\r\n4. <b>Car Launcher</b>\r\nOur car play for android/auto sync app gives you a car launcher feature through which you can access real-time data like time, temperature and speed for different car models: BMW i8 Spyder, Chevrolet Spark, Volvo Concept Estate 2014, Audi Quattro 2014, BMW 7 Sport Mode. Car launcher feature gives you access to vehicle\u2019s data from your dashboard. You can easily monitor your car speed with the Speedometer. Our Car Launcher can be used for any car to monitor the real time speed with speedometer.\r\n\r\n5.<b>Tesla Charging Station:</b>\r\nThis new feature of Tesla Charging Station in our Car Play for Android/Auto sync app will help you find nearby Tesla charging stations around you. You can find Nearby Tesla Charging Stations right from your car dashboard with our latest update. View Tesla charging station locations on the Map to quickly find Tesla charging station near to you.\r\n\r\nDownload Car Play for Android/Auto sync for staying focused and enhancing your safety\u00a0on\u00a0the\u00a0road!",
